--- rendered ---
error[E-unit-suffix]: `%` takes no prefix
  --> infix_suffix.spl:1:10
  |
1 | let a = 4k7%;
  |          ^ `k` can't be a prefix here
  |
  = help: in this form `k` marks the decimal point, but `%` takes no prefix: write `.` instead

error[E-unit-suffix]: `°C` takes no prefix
  --> infix_suffix.spl:2:10
  |
2 | let b = 4m7°C;
  |          ^ `m` can't be a prefix here
  |
  = help: in this form `m` marks the decimal point, but `°C` takes no prefix: write `.` instead

error[E-unit-suffix]: unknown unit `in`
  --> infix_suffix.spl:3:12
  |
3 | let c = 4k7in;
  |            ^^ not a unit or prefix
  |
  = note: units are V A Ω F H Hz s W K °C % dB, optionally after a prefix f p n u µ m k M G T (case matters)

error[E-unit-suffix]: unknown unit `mhz`
  --> infix_suffix.spl:4:10
  |
4 | let d = 1mhz;
  |          ^^^ not a unit or prefix
  |
  = help: did you mean `mHz` or `MHz`?
  = note: units are V A Ω F H Hz s W K °C % dB, optionally after a prefix f p n u µ m k M G T (case matters)

error[E-unit-suffix]: unknown unit `v`
